[{"id":184,"date":"2026-11-03T08:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-11-03T13:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/?p=184"},"modified":"2026-11-03T08:00:00","modified_gmt":"2026-11-03T13:00:00","slug":"week-8-in-review-cardinals-stun-cowboys-from-23","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/week-8-in-review-cardinals-stun-cowboys-from-23\/","title":{"rendered":"Week 8 in review: Cardinals stun Cowboys from 23%"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"dbd-post\">\n<p class=\"open\">Three upsets, four comebacks and two overtime games. The <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/team\/ari\/\">Cardinals<\/a> were 23% to win at kickoff, fell to 2% during the game, and still beat the Cowboys 33-30 in overtime.<\/p>\n<p>On a bye: Texans, Saints, Giants and 49ers.<\/p>\n<h2>The scores<\/h2>\n<table class=\"sc\">\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-titans-at-bengals\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/cin.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Bengals<\/b> 43, Titans 36<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\">Comeback from 21% \u00b7 Overtime<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-raiders-at-jets\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/lv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Raiders<\/b> 38, Jets 33<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\">Upset \u00b7 46% at kickoff \u00b7 Comeback from 14%<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-chiefs-at-broncos\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/den.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Broncos<\/b> 28, Chiefs 24<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\">Comeback from 7%<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-vikings-at-lions\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/det.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Lions<\/b> 19, Vikings 15<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\"><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-panthers-at-packers\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/gb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Packers<\/b> 27, Panthers 19<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\"><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-cardinals-at-cowboys\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/ari.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Cardinals<\/b> 33, Cowboys 30<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\">Upset \u00b7 23% at kickoff \u00b7 Comeback from 2% \u00b7 Overtime<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-patriots-at-dolphins\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/ne.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Patriots<\/b> 24, Dolphins 19<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\"><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-chargers-at-rams\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/lar.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Rams<\/b> 24, Chargers 9<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\"><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-eagles-at-commanders\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/wsh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Commanders<\/b> 27, Eagles 10<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\"><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-bears-at-seahawks\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/chi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Bears<\/b> 34, Seahawks 17<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\">Upset \u00b7 40% at kickoff<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-falcons-at-buccaneers\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/tb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Buccaneers<\/b> 16, Falcons 0<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\"><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-browns-at-steelers\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/pit.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Steelers<\/b> 27, Browns 6<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\">Led all the way<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-ravens-at-bills\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/buf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Bills<\/b> 36, Ravens 10<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\">Led all the way<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-colts-at-jaguars\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/jax.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>Jaguars<\/b> 42, Colts 7<\/a><\/td>\n<td class=\"tg\">Led all the way<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table>\n<h2>The swing and the play<\/h2>\n<p>The week\u2019s biggest swing came in the Cardinals\u2019 game against the Cowboys, with 0:10 left in the fourth quarter: G.Minshew pass short middle to Mi.Wilson for 13 yards, TOUCHDOWN. It moved the Cardinals\u2019 chance of winning by 46 points, and they won 33-30. <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-cardinals-at-cowboys\/\">Open the game<\/a><\/p>\n<p>The best single play by expected points was the Chiefs\u2019 against the Broncos, with 7:54 left in the second quarter: P.Mahomes pass short left to E.Johnson for 73 yards, TOUCHDOWN. It was worth +7.02 EPA. <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-8-chiefs-at-broncos\/\">Open the game<\/a><\/p>\n<h2>Best offense, best defense<\/h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/team\/nyj\/\">Jets<\/a> had the week\u2019s best offense, +0.25 EPA a play in a 38-33 loss to the Raiders. Their usual is +0.01. The <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/team\/tb\/defense\/\">Buccaneers<\/a> had the best defense, holding the Falcons to \u22120.52 a play in a 16-0 win. Their usual is \u22120.11 allowed.<\/p>\n<h2>Players of the week<\/h2>\n<p>The top quarterback, back, receiver and tight end by expected points added.<\/p>\n<table class=\"pl\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ph\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"hs\" src=\"https:\/\/static.www.nfl.com\/image\/upload\/f_auto,q_auto,w_80,h_80,c_fill,g_face\/league\/za7cynvpwlsro1tsaijk\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#000000\"><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/kirk-cousins\/\"><b>Kirk Cousins<\/b><\/a><small>QB \u00b7 Raiders vs Jets<\/small><\/td>\n<td class=\"ln\">19\/26, 247 yds, 3 TD \u00b7 5-3 rush<span>+18.4 EPA<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ph\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"hs\" src=\"https:\/\/static.www.nfl.com\/image\/upload\/f_auto,q_auto,w_80,h_80,c_fill,g_face\/league\/sp9lhhmpv4qy3xy2msxd\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#97233F\"><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/tyler-allgeier\/\"><b>Tyler Allgeier<\/b><\/a><small>RB \u00b7 Cardinals vs Cowboys<\/small><\/td>\n<td class=\"ln\">11 car, 147 yds, 1 TD \u00b7 5-44 rec<span>+11.7 EPA<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ph\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"hs\" src=\"https:\/\/static.www.nfl.com\/image\/upload\/f_auto,q_auto,w_80,h_80,c_fill,g_face\/league\/gpwtyv3viwy9q4ewderl\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#FB4F14\"><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/tee-higgins\/\"><b>Tee Higgins<\/b><\/a><small>WR \u00b7 Bengals vs Titans<\/small><\/td>\n<td class=\"ln\">10\/11, 155 yds, 2 TD<span>+14.9 EPA<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ph\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"hs\" src=\"https:\/\/static.www.nfl.com\/image\/upload\/f_auto,q_auto,w_80,h_80,c_fill,g_face\/league\/waorceny0ggpaeckaol8\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#000000\"><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/brock-bowers\/\"><b>Brock Bowers<\/b><\/a><small>TE \u00b7 Raiders vs Jets<\/small><\/td>\n<td class=\"ln\">7\/10, 92 yds, 2 TD<span>+9.2 EPA<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table>\n<h2>Fantasy<\/h2>\n<p>The week\u2019s top five in half-PPR scoring.<\/p>\n<table class=\"pl\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ph\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"hs\" src=\"https:\/\/static.www.nfl.com\/image\/upload\/f_auto,q_auto,w_80,h_80,c_fill,g_face\/league\/gnnvcgui1cijybukk2w7\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#FB4F14\"><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/joe-burrow\/\"><b>Joe Burrow<\/b><\/a><small>QB \u00b7 Bengals vs Titans<\/small><\/td>\n<td class=\"ln\"><b>39.5<\/b> half PPR<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ph\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"hs\" src=\"https:\/\/static.www.nfl.com\/image\/upload\/f_auto,q_auto,w_80,h_80,c_fill,g_face\/league\/sp9lhhmpv4qy3xy2msxd\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#97233F\"><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/tyler-allgeier\/\"><b>Tyler Allgeier<\/b><\/a><small>RB \u00b7 Cardinals vs Cowboys<\/small><\/td>\n<td class=\"ln\"><b>33.6<\/b> half PPR<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ph\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"hs\" src=\"https:\/\/static.www.nfl.com\/image\/upload\/f_auto,q_auto,w_80,h_80,c_fill,g_face\/league\/gpwtyv3viwy9q4ewderl\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#FB4F14\"><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/tee-higgins\/\"><b>Tee Higgins<\/b><\/a><small>WR \u00b7 Bengals vs Titans<\/small><\/td>\n<td class=\"ln\"><b>32.5<\/b> half PPR<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ph\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"hs\" src=\"https:\/\/static.www.nfl.com\/image\/upload\/f_auto,q_auto,w_80,h_80,c_fill,g_face\/league\/ryjnphuyjbedmgpx5qqj\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#006778\"><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/bhayshul-tuten\/\"><b>Bhayshul Tuten<\/b><\/a><small>RB \u00b7 Jaguars vs Colts<\/small><\/td>\n<td class=\"ln\"><b>28.9<\/b> half PPR<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ph\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"hs\" src=\"https:\/\/static.www.nfl.com\/image\/upload\/f_auto,q_auto,w_80,h_80,c_fill,g_face\/league\/za7cynvpwlsro1tsaijk\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#000000\"><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/kirk-cousins\/\"><b>Kirk Cousins<\/b><\/a><small>QB \u00b7 Raiders vs Jets<\/small><\/td>\n<td class=\"ln\"><b>28.2<\/b> half PPR<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table>\n<h2>Rising<\/h2>\n<p>The biggest jumps in share of the team\u2019s targets, against their own earlier games: <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/kenny-gainwell\/\">Kenny Gainwell<\/a> (Buccaneers, 8% to 33%), <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/justice-hill\/\">Justice Hill<\/a> (Ravens, 8% to 31%) and <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/ted-hurst-iii\/\">Ted Hurst III<\/a> (Buccaneers, 11% to 33%).<\/p>\n<p>New faces: <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/gardner-minshew\/\">Gardner Minshew<\/a> (first game of the season for the Cardinals, 42% of snaps), <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/joe-fagnano\/\">Joe Fagnano<\/a> (first game of the season for the Ravens, 40% of snaps) and <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/player\/james-mitchell\/\">James Mitchell<\/a> (first game of the season for the Cowboys, 42% of snaps).<\/p>\n<h2>Next week<\/h2>\n<p class=\"next\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/det.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" loading=\"lazy\">Lions at Dolphins<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lg\" src=\"https:\/\/a.espncdn.com\/i\/teamlogos\/nfl\/500\/mia.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" loading=\"lazy\"><\/p>\n<p>The game of the week is Sunday at 1:00 PM ET. Its biggest edge: Lions gain +0.25 EPA per dropback (2nd). Dolphins allow +0.30 (32nd). <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/game\/2026-week-9-lions-at-dolphins\/\">Open the matchup<\/a><\/p>\n<p class=\"full\">Every play, every team and every player from Week 8 is on <a href=\"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/week\/8\/\">the week page<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Three upsets, four comebacks and two overtime games. The Cardinals were 23% to win at kickoff, fell to 2% during the game, and still beat the Cowboys 33-30 in overtime.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":185,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[6],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-184","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-week-in-review"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/184","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=184"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/downbydown.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/184\/revisions"}],